title: >-
  Deliverome surfaceome library v1: design pipeline, construct catalog,
  and external review package
message: >-
  If you use this library design, construct catalog, or pipeline code,
  please cite it using the metadata below. Code is licensed under MIT
  and derived library designs, tables, and documentation are dedicated
  to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (see LICENSE and LICENSING.md).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rebecca J.
    family-names: Carlson
    affiliation: Deliverome Bio, Inc.
    email: becca@deliverome.org
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5423-9717'
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/Deliverome-Project/deliverome-surfaceome-library-v1
url: 'https://surfaceome.deliverome.org/v1-review/'
abstract: >-
  Design pipeline, construct tables, verification tests, and external
  review brief for the Deliverome v1 pooled, barcoded lentiviral
  surface-protein ORF library (L1 in code). The library covers 2,762
  active cell-surface protein CDSs (2,412 human reference proteins,
  150 human isoforms, and 200 mouse and cynomolgus orthologs; 3,384
  ordered constructs), each carrying a 51-aa extracellular SpyTag003
  and ALFA dual-epitope tag cassette and a 20-nt barcode compatible
  with FACS, optical pooled screening, and 10x Genomics Feature
  Barcoding.
keywords:
  - surfaceome
  - cell surface proteins
  - ORF library
  - lentiviral library
  - endocytosis
  - internalization
  - protein tagging
  - bioinformatics
